8ci4|v|To mark with lines, scratches, or notches; to cut notches or furrows in; to notch; to scratch; to furrow; as, to score timber for hewing; to score the back with a lash. ; Especially, to mark with significant lines or notches, for indicating or keeping account of something; as, to score a tally. ; To mark or signify by lines or notches; to keep record or account of; to set down; to record; to charge. ; To engrave, as upon a shield. ; To make a score of, as points, runs, etc., in a game. ; To write down in proper order and arrangement; as, to score an overture for an orchestra. See Score, n., 9.	o:7xu0,84,7;7s2w,47,3;8cil,37,1;2ysx,31,1;40pt,26,1;115m,18,18;94gy,14,2;ac1q,12,11;n03,12,2;975y,11,10;148m,10,2;7vsa,9,1;4hiu,7,4;3s8x,7,34;2gm7,5,2~3s8x,7,34;115m,18,18;ac1q,12,11;975y,11,10;7xu0,84,7;4hiu,7,4;g1d,2,3;7s2w,47,3;5xul,2,2;n03,12,2;148m,10,2;94gy,14,2;2gm7,5,2;40pt,26,1;2ysx,31,1	s:4tgf,81,5;b4g,73,2;ak19,68,8;38pc,61,28;1ig5,54,1;fsa,53,1;4x13,49,2;t25,47,5;499q,47,2;7ma9,47,7;233m,47,6;56wl,44,2;9dwq,43,6;2zvo,43,2;8b3i,42,12~76t4,17,263;su,11,240;9ga4,12,52;38pc,61,28;4vwd,22,25;ak3p,25,16;6os2,13,14;1f82,23,12;8b3i,42,12;m7h,35,11;ak19,68,8;akp3,17,8;e8x,7,7;7ma9,47,7;2ns0,23,6	d:d6j,68,1;50ho,41,1;4600,29,4;4qui,24,2;55ts,22,8;e8x,18,15;593c,16,12;3k6j,4,1~e8x,18,15;593c,16,12;55ts,22,8;4600,29,4;4qui,24,2;d6j,68,1;3k6j,4,1;50ho,41,1	D:6anc,35,2;vxp,19,1;68i9,6,9~68i9,6,9;6anc,35,2;vxp,19,1
